{
	"title": "Trois points alignés ? Vérifie à la règle",
	"description": "Tracer la droite par deux points pour dire si un troisième, presque dessus, est aligné avec eux (réponse oui / non)",
	"grades": ["CP"],
	"theme": "Géométrie",
	"domain": "Tracés",
	"subdomain": "Droites",
	"level": 1,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Les points $A$, $B$ et $C$ sont-ils alignés ? Tu peux tracer la droite $({{if:k==3|B|A}}{{if:k==1|B|C}})$ pour vérifier.\n\n```figure-de-travail\nfenetre: 0 ; 10 ; 0 ; 6\noutils: droite\n---\nA = point({{xa}}, {{ya}})\nB = point({{xb}}, {{yb}})\nC = point({{xc}}, {{yc}})\n```\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- Oui\n- Non\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "0..1"
				},
				{
					"name": "x1",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "dx",
					"expression": "3..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "x2",
					"expression": "eval:x1 + 2*dx"
				},
				{
					"name": "yb1",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "dy",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "yh1",
					"expression": "eval:yb1 + 2*dy"
				},
				{
					"name": "y1",
					"expression": "{{if:s==0|{{yb1}}|{{yh1}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "y2",
					"expression": "{{if:s==0|{{yh1}}|{{yb1}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "x3",
					"expression": "eval:(x1 + x2)/2"
				},
				{
					"name": "y3",
					"expression": "eval:(y1 + y2)/2"
				},
				{
					"name": "xa",
					"expression": "{{if:k==3|{{x3}}|{{x1}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "ya",
					"expression": "{{if:k==3|{{y3}}|{{y1}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "xb",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|{{x2}}|{{if:k==2|{{x3}}|{{x1}}}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "yb",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|{{y2}}|{{if:k==2|{{y3}}|{{y1}}}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "xc",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|{{x3}}|{{x2}}}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "yc",
					"expression": "{{if:k==1|{{y3}}|{{y2}}}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["x2 <= 9", "yh1 <= 5"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": ""
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "0"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On pose la règle sur les points ${{if:k==3|B|A}}$ et ${{if:k==1|B|C}}$ et on trace la droite $({{if:k==3|B|A}}{{if:k==1|B|C}})$.",
					"Elle passe par le point ${{if:k==1|C|{{if:k==2|B|A}}}}$ : les trois points sont alignés."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Les points $A$, $B$ et $C$ sont-ils alignés ? Tu peux tracer la droite $({{if:k==3|B|A}}{{if:k==1|B|C}})$ pour vérifier.\n\n```figure-de-travail\nfenetre: 0 ; 10 ; 0 ; 6\noutils: droite\n---\nA = point({{xa}}, {{ya}})\nB = point({{xb}}, {{yb}})\nC = point({{xc}}, {{yc}})\n```\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- Oui\n- Non\n```",
